OL,3,AStorm Boelo brings 85mph gusts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption with amber weather
OL,5,Awarnings in effect
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing more travel
OL,8,Fdisruption to the UK, afters gusts of
OL,9,F85mph (137 km/h) were recorded
OL,10,Fovernight
OL,12,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,13,Facross large parts of Scotland,
OL,14,Fnorthern England and parts of Northern
OL,15,FIreland
OL,17,FA further yellow warning for wind will
OL,18,Fremain in place until 21:00 GMT for
OL,19,Fmost of Scotland, including the Orkney
OL,20,FIslands, and northern England
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
